=== rt_runtime__fundamentals__workspaces.md:784-795 ===
Define a catalog in the root `deno.json`:

```jsonc title="deno.json"
{
  "workspace": ["./packages/a", "./packages/b"],
  "catalog": {
    "react": "^18.3.0",
    "react-dom": "^18.3.0",
    "chalk": "^5.3.0"
  }
}
```
